; Export forwarding table for the mfxproxy timing shim.
;
; Generated from the real Intel oneVPL dispatcher with:
;   scripts/pe-exports.py libvpl.dll --module-target libvpl_real \
;       --exclude MFXVideoENCODE_EncodeFrameAsync,MFXVideoCORE_SyncOperation
; (62 named exports, 0 ordinal-only exports, no pre-existing forwarders).
;
; Every entry is a PE forwarder resolved by the loader against libvpl_real.dll, which must be a byte
; copy of the untouched dispatcher reachable through the normal search path. The two excluded names
; are implemented in mfxproxy.c and are therefore exported without a forward target.
